<translate>
<!--T:1-->
he '''{{Code|Type}}''' parameter defines the class the item will be instantiated as. All items are created as an
</translate> {{JavaObject|InventoryItem|package=zombie/inventory|customDoc=https://demiurgequantified.github.io/ProjectZomboidJavaDocs/}}<translate>
<!--T:2-->
's subclass, based on the value of this parameter. The various parameters the {{ll|item (scripts)|item script}} can have are dependent on the class of the item; such as food items will hold nutritional values and weapon items will hold damage values.

<!--T:3-->
The possible values are:
* AlarmClock
* AlarmClockClothing
* Animal
* Clothing
* Container
* Drainable
* Food
* Key
* Literature
* Map
* Moveable
* Normal
* Radio
* Weapon
* WeaponPart

<!--T:4-->
Below is an example for the parameter:
</translate>
{{CodeSnip| code =
Type = Food,
}}

